UnaryExpr   = Cast | Clone | InstanceofExpr | PreIncDec | Neg | Pos | BitNot | NotOp
            | Suppress | ThrowExpr | PrintExpr | YieldExpr | PowExpr ;
NotOp       <~~ push(makeNot(pop())) ~~>
